      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "There are places in the Spiral where magic is more potent, owing to a convergence of the Leylines - the invisible branches of the World Tree.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_011.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "It is in these places Spell Trees are more likely to grow and where rare applications of magic can be attempted.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_012.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "This Grove is one of the more unique of these places... a spot where the six fundamental schools of magic intersect, and the Spell Trees are...",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_013.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Interwoven. This is where the Order of the Fang will be reborn into a think tank devoted to Magic Weaving, to intersecting the Schools of Magic.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_014.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I hope you will be willing to help. But first we must expand upon your knowledge of the Schools and their interactions.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_015.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Enter the Training Grounds and I will teach you of the Magic Wheel.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_016.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "This Grove and these interwoven Spell Trees are where we hope to explore magic, its synergies, its counters and influences.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_063.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You may join us here and choose a second School as an area of focus to weave into your own.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_064.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The choice is yours; each School has its own benefits as we discussed. Is that not so, my friends?",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_065.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The choice is yours, Wizard. Simply speak to your chosen tree and they will guide you in weaving a new School. Just remember:",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_066.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Magic is not merely about damage boosts; look for countermeasures for each School's tactics.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_067.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GROVE-NPC-01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "When you're ready, you should return to your Headmaster; I wouldn't want this to derail your more traditional studies.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Krok_Alhazred_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KT_SL_and_SpellWeaving|WorldData|Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Raafat_KT-PreCel_068.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1634253,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
